// Base configuration of the Runner target's Debug-prod configuration (Ruling P9-R5).
// The Pods settings come first; the include is optional, so the project
// still builds before pod install. Debug.xcconfig then brings
// Generated.xcconfig, the AdMob test-id default and the optional
// Secrets.xcconfig, which must stay last. (unverified, Mac; DM-106)
// When CocoaPods is used, flutter_tools also adds an include of
// Pods-Runner.debug.xcconfig to Debug.xcconfig, so the Pods settings
// arrive twice. Both come from the same :debug build type with
// $(CONFIGURATION)-relative paths, so that is harmless; commit the line.
#include? "Pods/Target Support Files/Pods-Runner/Pods-Runner.debug-prod.xcconfig"
#include "Debug.xcconfig"
